English language pack (Maktaba, Epic 52, story 52.5)

The pack's code, acronyms.txt and transliterations.txt are Maktaba's.

Its dictionary data (the lang.en asset: en_US.aff/.dic and en_GB.aff/.dic) comes from
LibreOffice's dictionaries repository, built from SCOWL (Spell Checker Oriented Word
Lists, Kevin Atkinson and contributors). SCOWL's licence is permissive (an MIT-like
licence that asks to keep the copyright notice); the full text ships in the asset next
to the files as README_en_US.txt / README_en_GB.txt.
